          "description": "The runner reads AWS every four hours. Current cost panels require a snapshot from this UTC month less than 14 hours old. AWS billing figures can lag behind that read.\n\nObservation budget: 180s for current evidence; backup/restore objectives and historical windows are separate. Source contract: observability/generated/panel-contracts.json."
